// Package dictionary: disabled-adults allowance (AAH, wave 4).
//
// The rules of `02-droit.law` derive the computation-level right on the two
// statutory tracks (L. 821-1 at 80 %+, L. 821-2 at 50-79 % with RSDAE) from
// the pinned fragments; the case supplies the commission-established rate
// and RSDAE facts (CDAPH channel, as AEEH), the age, residence and
// regular-stay facts, and the retained resource and amount inputs
// (provenance — case facts; the resource computation mechanics and the
// euro amounts are neighbours/boundaries, see below).
//
// DEONTIC MAP OVER PINNED TEXTS ONLY (bytes of 01-sources.law; outside
// them — boundary, not conjecture).
//
//   D1. Duty of the fund to pay. «est servie comme une prestation
//   familiale» (L. 821-5, para. 1) + «la gestion ... est confiée aux
//   organismes ... chargés du versement des prestations familiales»
//   (L. 821-7, unmodelled bearer). The duty triggers on aah_montant_du
//   (right + computed amount). The debtor fund unnamed in the pinned scope
//   — the «debtor fund of the case» link is empirical
//   (deontic-migration.md pattern), performance is the empirical fact
//   aah_versee. Window [@2021-01-01, ∞) is the package coverage window.
//   Recovery and limitation (L. 821-5 paras. 2-3, L. 821-5-1) are package
//   fr.prestations.versement (wave 5).
//   P1. Attribution power of the CDAPH commission (L. 821-4: «accordée ...
//   sur décision de la commission ... appréciant le niveau d'incapacité»):
//   holder the commission, exercise attribution_prononcee, effect the
//   established decision facts. Window [@2021-01-01, ∞).
//   D2. Recipient duty to report (R. 821-4-5, I): residence, family
//   situation, professional activities of the household — holder the
//   beneficiary, exercise changement_signale.
//   D3. Quarterly declaration duty (R. 821-4-5, II, for the R. 821-4-1
//   track): holder the beneficiary, exercise declaration_trimestrielle.
//   No sanctions or recovery procedures in scope: cross recovery under
//   L. 553-2 / L. 821-5-1 is package fr.prestations.versement (wave 5).
//
// LAYER BOUNDARIES (omission records, not norms):
// B-AAH-TETE: the computation-level head is carried by this package on its
// own commission-established facts. No upstream package holds parallel
// filters for AAH: the case asserts the local symbols directly.
// B-AAH-MONTANT-EURO: RESOLVED 08.10.2026. The monthly AAH euro amount
// (L. 821-3-1 «fixé par décret», revalued on 1 April by the L. 161-25
// coefficient) is pinned: decrees 2019-1047 ... 2026-229, the DSS coefficient
// paragraphs and article 9 of act 2022-1158 (sources/montant/,
// tools/pin_montant.py). 07-montant-chaine.law (generated by
// tools/build_montant_chaine.py) carries the decree amount of each window as
// montant_aah_applicable, builds the chain (previous amount x coefficient,
// rounded to the centime: the reading AahRevalorisationArrondiCentime, D-82)
// and checks it against the published amounts and against a case-supplied
// amount. A case-supplied montant_mensuel_retenu still prevails over the decree.
// Placeholder REMOVED 08.10.2026 (D-83): the what-if input
// facteur_revalorisation_retenu and the rule MontantRevalorise are gone; the
// amount is BUILT by the chain (07-montant-chaine.law), nothing else revalues it.
// D. 821-2 al. 3 divisions («douzième», «tiers»): exact division by default;
// a non-terminating quotient is INEXACT_DIVISION. The reading
// DouziemeTiersArrondiCentime (03-montant.law, D-82/D-83, fund practice) rounds
// the quotient to the centime, half up; it is selected in the context.
// B-AAH-SMIC: the gross monthly SMIC for 151.67 h (D. 821-5 cap) arrives
// per case as smic_brut_mensuel_retenu (smic series 2021-2025 awaits the
// farm, W0-07).
// B-AAH-RESSOURCES-CALCUL: the resource computation mechanics (R. 532-3 N-2
// year, R. 821-4-II exclusions, R. 821-4-3/4-4 events, D. 821-6/9/10
// abatements) are not modelled; annual, quarterly and (pre-2023) spouse
// resources arrive as retained case facts (GOAL boundary: no DSN
// extraction). The annual/quarterly routing (R. 821-4 vs R. 821-4-1) IS
// modelled on the activity fact.
// B-AAH-VIEILLESSE: pension/invalidity coordination (L. 821-1 paras. 9-11,
// differential top-up, continued service): needs external-regime pension
// amounts — not modelled.
// B-AAH-DUREE: award durations, revision, renewal procedure, advance on
// renewal, silence (R. 821-5, R. 821-7, L. 821-7-1) — duration facts are
// absent by construction. The renewal-gap question of decree 2022-1694
// art. 2 is modelled as named readings §152 (SensRenouvellement group).
// B-AAH-HEBERGEMENT: hosting/hospitalisation/detention reduction (L. 821-6,
// R. 821-8, 60 days, 30 %) — period facts absent.
// B-AAH-RESIDENCE: stay-abroad and study details (R. 821-1), foreigner
// permit list (D. 821-8) — permanent-residence and regular-stay facts.
// B-AAH-MVA: majoration pour la vie autonome (L. 821-1-2, D. 821-3 figure
// 104,77) and complement de ressources (L. 821-1-1 abrogated): needs
// housing-aid facts owned by fr.apl — not modelled.
// B-AAH-PROCEDURE: MDPH filing and fund liquidation procedure (R. 821-2,
// R. 821-6, R. 821-7, R. 821-7-1): the commission decision arrives as the
// established fact; the start-of-right month rule is not modelled.
//
// INPUT CONTRACT (engine has no absence test): exactly one of
// {decision_cdaph_80, decision_cdaph_50_79} per claimant; the RSDAE arrives
// as the commission-established fact rsdae_reconnue (DECISION-0194 channel 2),
// its absence means no RSDAE; exactly one resource regime
// {sans_revenu_activite, percoit_revenu_activite}; montant_mensuel_retenu
// optional (absent: the pinned decree amount of the window); ESAT facts only with remuneration_garantie_retenue.
//
// Scenarios: tests/aah-*.lawtest (families fr.css.aah#droit /
// #montant / #deconjugalisation / #cumul-esat / #devoirs in law.toml):
// inputs→value; boundary pairs (rate edges 50/80, couple edges, Oct-2023
// edges, irreversible switch, reading-dependent renewal gap); OpenFisca
// AAH selected cases (family #openfisca-import); positions: ACTIVE /
// power exercisable.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.css.aah version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:aah";

pub entity Personne {
    label fr official "personne demandant ou bénéficiant de l'allocation aux adultes handicapés";
    label en unofficial "person claiming or receiving the disabled-adults allowance";
}

pub entity Organisme {
    label fr official "organisme débiteur chargé du versement des prestations familiales (L. 821-7 — porteur empirique)";
    label en unofficial "debtor body in charge of paying family benefits (L. 821-7 - empirical bearer)";
}

pub entity CommissionCdaph {
    label fr official "commission des droits et de l'autonomie des personnes handicapées, L. 146-9 CASF (L. 821-4)";
    label en unofficial "rights and autonomy commission for disabled persons, L. 146-9 CASF (L. 821-4)";
}

pub relation organisme_debiteur_aah(o: Organisme, p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "organisme débiteur de l'allocation pour le bénéficiaire (L. 821-7 — lien empirique)";
    label en unofficial "body owing the allowance to the payee (L. 821-7 - empirical link)";
}

pub relation commission_competente(c: CommissionCdaph, p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "commission territorialement compétente pour la personne (L. 821-4 — lien empirique)";
    label en unofficial "commission with territorial jurisdiction over the person (L. 821-4 - empirical link)";
}

pub relation sans_esat(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "aucune rémunération garantie L. 243-4 CASF (pas de cumul ESAT)";
    label en unofficial "no L. 243-4 CASF guaranteed pay (no sheltered-workshop cumulation)";
}

pub relation decision_cdaph_80(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "décision de la commission L. 146-9 CASF fixant un taux d'incapacité permanente d'au moins 80 % (L. 821-1, D. 821-1 — fait établi, adjudicated)";
    label en unofficial "L. 146-9 CASF commission decision setting a permanent incapacity rate of at least 80% (L. 821-1, D. 821-1 - established fact)";
}

pub relation decision_cdaph_50_79(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "décision de la commission L. 146-9 CASF fixant un taux d'incapacité permanente de 50 à 79 % (L. 821-2, D. 821-1 — fait établi, adjudicated)";
    label en unofficial "L. 146-9 CASF commission decision setting a permanent incapacity rate of 50 to 79% (L. 821-2, D. 821-1 - established fact)";
}

pub relation rsdae_reconnue(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "restriction substantielle et durable pour l'accès à l'emploi reconnue par la commission compte tenu du handicap (L. 821-2 2° — fait établi, adjudicated)";
    label en unofficial "substantial and lasting restriction on access to employment recognised by the commission given the disability (L. 821-2 2 - established fact)";
}

pub relation age_droit_depasse(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "âge d'ouverture du droit à l'allocation L. 541-1 dépassé (L. 821-1 al. 1er)";
    label en unofficial "past the opening age for the L. 541-1 allowance (L. 821-1 para. 1)";
}

pub relation residence_permanente(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "résidence permanente sur le territoire métropolitain ou les collectivités L. 111-2 (L. 821-1 al. 1er, R. 821-1 — hors détail)";
    label en unofficial "permanent residence on metropolitan territory or listed communities (L. 821-1 para. 1, R. 821-1 - detail out of scope)";
}

pub relation sejour_regulier(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "situation régulière au regard de la législation sur le séjour, ou dispense UE/EEE (L. 821-1 al. 2-5 — hors détail)";
    label en unofficial "regular stay under residence legislation, or EU/EEA exemption (L. 821-1 paras. 2-5 - detail out of scope)";
}

pub relation sans_revenu_activite(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "ne perçoit pas de revenu d'activité professionnelle et n'est pas en ESAT (régime R. 821-4)";
    label en unofficial "receives no professional activity income and is not in a sheltered workshop (R. 821-4 track)";
}

pub relation percoit_revenu_activite(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "perçoit des revenus d'activité professionnelle ou en ESAT au jour de la demande ou en cours de service (régime R. 821-4-1)";
    label en unofficial "receives professional activity or sheltered-workshop income at application or during service (R. 821-4-1 track)";
}

pub relation ressources_annuelles_retenues(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "ressources annuelles de l'année civile de référence retenues pour le calcul (R. 821-4 — hors mécanique, fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "retained annual resources of the reference calendar year (R. 821-4 - mechanics out of scope, case fact)";
}

pub relation ressources_trimestrielles_retenues(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "ressources du trimestre de référence retenues pour le calcul (R. 821-4-1 — hors mécanique, fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "retained resources of the reference quarter (R. 821-4-1 - mechanics out of scope, case fact)";
}

pub relation ressources_conjoint_retenues(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "ressources du conjoint, concubin ou partenaire retenues sous les règles au 30.09.2023 (L. 821-3 ancien — double calcul)";
    label en unofficial "retained spouse, cohabitant or partner resources under the 30.09.2023 rules (former L. 821-3 - double calculation)";
}

pub relation en_couple(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "marié et non séparé, lié par un pacte civil de solidarité ou en concubinage";
    label en unofficial "married and not separated, in a civil solidarity pact or cohabiting";
}

pub relation personne_seule(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "ni marié, ni lié par un pacte civil de solidarité, ni en concubinage";
    label en unofficial "neither married, in a civil solidarity pact nor cohabiting";
}

pub relation enfants_charge(nombre: Integer) kind empirical {
    label fr official "nombre d'enfants à charge au sens des articles L. 512-3, L. 512-4 et L. 521-2 (D. 821-2 al. 2)";
    label en unofficial "number of dependent children under L. 512-3, L. 512-4 and L. 521-2 (D. 821-2 para. 2)";
}

pub relation ascendant_charge(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "ascendant à charge au sens du 3° de l'article L. 161-1 (D. 821-5)";
    label en unofficial "dependent ascendant under L. 161-1 3 (D. 821-5)";
}

pub relation montant_mensuel_retenu(montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "montant mensuel de l'allocation fixé selon L. 821-3-1 fourni pour l'espèce (prévaut sur le montant du décret épinglé)";
    label en unofficial "monthly allowance amount under L. 821-3-1 supplied for the case (prevails over the pinned decree amount)";
}

pub relation remuneration_garantie_retenue(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "rémunération garantie L. 243-4 CASF retenue pour le cumul ESAT (D. 821-5 — hors abattements D. 821-10)";
    label en unofficial "retained L. 243-4 CASF guaranteed pay for the sheltered-workshop cap (D. 821-5 - D. 821-10 abatements out of scope)";
}

pub relation smic_brut_mensuel_retenu(montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "salaire minimum brut de croissance mensuel pour 151,67 heures retenu (D. 821-5 — série SMIC hors champ, B-AAH-SMIC)";
    label en unofficial "retained monthly gross minimum wage for 151.67 hours (D. 821-5 - SMIC series out of scope)";
}

pub relation beneficiaire_au_1er_octobre_2023(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "bénéficiaire de l'allocation au 01.10.2023 (décret 2022-1694 art. 2 — double calcul)";
    label en unofficial "allowance beneficiary on 01.10.2023 (decree 2022-1694 art. 2 - double calculation)";
}

pub relation maintien_eteint(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "maintien des modalités au 30.09.2023 définitivement éteint lors d'une période antérieure (décret 2022-1694 art. 2 in fine)";
    label en unofficial "maintenance of the 30.09.2023 rules definitively extinguished in an earlier period (decree 2022-1694 art. 2 in fine)";
}

pub relation renouvellement_apres_rupture(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "droit rouvert par une nouvelle demande après extinction du droit antérieur (lacune — groupe SensRenouvellement §152)";
    label en unofficial "right reopened by a new claim after the earlier right lapsed (gap - SensRenouvellement §152 group)";
}

pub relation changement_signale(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "action: informations de résidence, de situation de famille et d'activités signalées à l'organisme (R. 821-4-5 I)";
    label en unofficial "action: residence, family and activity information reported to the body (R. 821-4-5 I)";
}

pub relation declaration_trimestrielle(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "action: déclaration trimestrielle de ressources retournée à l'organisme (R. 821-4-5 II)";
    label en unofficial "action: quarterly resource declaration returned to the body (R. 821-4-5 II)";
}

pub relation attribution_prononcee(p: Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "action: attribution prononcée par la commission des droits et de l'autonomie (L. 821-4)";
    label en unofficial "action: award ordered by the rights and autonomy commission (L. 821-4)";
}

pub relation aah_versee(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    label fr official "versement constaté de l'allocation au bénéficiaire (exécution; l'organisme figure au porteur)";
    label en unofficial "recorded payment of the allowance to the payee";
}

pub relation aah_droit_80(p: Personne) kind institutional {
    label fr official "droit à l'AAH au niveau calcul, filière 80 % et plus (L. 821-1, D. 821-1)";
    label en unofficial "AAH entitlement at computation level, 80% and over track (L. 821-1, D. 821-1)";
}

pub relation aah_droit_50_79(p: Personne) kind institutional {
    label fr official "droit à l'AAH au niveau calcul, filière 50-79 % avec RSDAE (L. 821-2, D. 821-1)";
    label en unofficial "AAH entitlement at computation level, 50-79% track with RSDAE (L. 821-2, D. 821-1)";
}

pub relation aah_droit_calcule(p: Personne) kind institutional {
    label fr official "droit à l'AAH au niveau calcul (l'une des deux filières)";
    label en unofficial "AAH entitlement at computation level (either track)";
}

pub relation aah_montant_nouveau(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    label fr official "montant mensuel sous les dispositions en vigueur à la date des droits (D. 821-2 nouveau)";
    label en unofficial "monthly amount under the rules in force at the date of the rights (current D. 821-2)";
}

pub relation aah_montant_ancien(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    label fr official "montant mensuel sous l'ensemble des dispositions en vigueur au 30.09.2023 (double calcul)";
    label en unofficial "monthly amount under all rules in force on 30.09.2023 (double calculation)";
}

pub relation aah_maintien_ancien_calcul(p: Personne) kind institutional {
    label fr official "maintien des modalités au 30.09.2023 (décret 2022-1694 art. 2)";
    label en unofficial "maintenance of the 30.09.2023 rules (decree 2022-1694 art. 2)";
}

pub relation aah_montant_rupture(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    label fr official "montant dû après renouvellement avec rupture, selon la lecture MaintienTantQue (groupe SensRenouvellement §152)";
    label en unofficial "amount due after renewal with a lapse, under the MaintienTantQue reading (SensRenouvellement §152 group)";
}

pub relation aah_montant_du(p: Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    label fr official "montant mensuel dû après double calcul et plafonds ESAT";
    label en unofficial "monthly amount due after double calculation and sheltered-workshop caps";
}

pub relation majoration_enfant_esat() kind institutional {
    label fr official "majoration ESAT pour enfant ou ascendant à charge applicable (D. 821-5, +15 %)";
    label en unofficial "sheltered-workshop increase for a dependent child or ascendant applies (D. 821-5, +15%)";
}

pub relation attribution_prend_effet(p: Personne) kind institutional {
    label fr official "l'attribution par la commission prend effet (L. 821-4)";
    label en unofficial "the commission's award takes effect (L. 821-4)";
}

pub relation lecture_douzieme_tiers_arrondis() kind institutional {
    label fr official "lecture retenue : le douzième et le tiers de la différence plafond − ressources (D. 821-2 al. 3) sont arrondis au centime (D-82, D-83 ; marqueur de la lecture DouziemeTiersArrondiCentime)";
    label en unofficial "selected reading: the twelfth and the third of the ceiling-minus-resources difference (D. 821-2 para. 3) are rounded to the centime (D-82, D-83; marker of the reading DouziemeTiersArrondiCentime)";
}
